-- A fuller refund and credits policy, plus the fair-use and payment clauses
-- that belong beside it.
--
-- Written to describe exactly what the code does. That is the real protection:
-- a policy that promises something the software does not do is worse than no
-- policy at all, because it is evidence against you.
--
-- Versions are bumped, so everyone accepts the new text.

UPDATE legal_documents
   SET title = 'Payments & Refunds',
       summary = 'Credits, when they are spent, and when money is refunded.',
       body = E'*Payments, Credits & Refunds*\n\nMastiPe is *free to play* during the trial period. No payment is taken from you at any point during the trial.\n\nWhen paid plans begin, MastiPe runs on *credits*. This section explains exactly how they work.\n\n*1. What credits are*\n• Credits are a prepaid balance held in your MastiPe wallet and used to pay for games.\n• Credits are *not money*. They have no cash value, cannot be withdrawn, cannot be transferred to another person, and cannot be exchanged for cash, goods or services outside MastiPe.\n• Credits are personal to your WhatsApp number.\n\n*2. When credits are spent*\nCredits are deducted at one moment only: *when the first number of a game is called.*\n• Creating a room costs nothing.\n• Pressing Start costs nothing.\n• If no number is ever called, *nothing is deducted.*\n\n*3. If nobody joins your game*\nNo number is called, so no credits are spent. Your balance is untouched and available for your next game. There is nothing to refund because nothing was charged.\n\n*4. If players leave, stop responding, or the game ends early*\nOnce the first number has been called, the game has been provided. Those credits are *not refundable*, whatever happens next. We cannot control whether other people keep playing, whether their phones have signal, or whether they lose interest.\n\n*5. If something goes wrong at our end*\nIf a fault in our service prevents a game you were charged for from being played, we will return those credits to your wallet. Contact support@mastipe.in within 7 days with the room code.\n\n*6. Money paid to buy credits*\nAmounts paid to purchase credits are *non-refundable* once the credits appear in your wallet. The credits themselves remain yours to use. This is because credits are delivered immediately and in full at the moment of purchase.\n\n*7. Free and promotional credits and games*\n• Free games and promotional credits are gifts. They are not purchased, have no cash value, and are *never refundable in money*.\n• We may add, withdraw, or set an expiry on promotional credits and free games at any time, including where we believe they have been obtained or used unfairly.\n• Free games are used before paid credits.\n\n*8. Corrections*\nIf credits are added to your wallet in error — a duplicated payment, a technical fault, or a mistake by us — we may correct the balance. We will tell you when we do.\n\n*9. Payment disputes*\nIf you raise a chargeback or payment dispute instead of contacting us, we may suspend your account and any unused credits while the dispute is resolved. Please write to us first; almost everything is quicker to fix directly.\n\n*10. Pricing*\nPrices may change. Any change applies to purchases made after it takes effect. Credits already in your wallet are unaffected.\n\n*11. If we stop offering the service*\nIf we discontinue MastiPe, we will give reasonable notice and a period in which to use remaining credits. Credits unused at the end of that period lapse.\n\n*12. Nothing here limits your statutory rights*\nWhere the law gives you a right that this policy appears to remove, the law applies.\n\nQuestions: support@mastipe.in',
       version = version + 1,
       effective_from = now(),
       updated_at = now()
 WHERE doc_key = 'refunds';

UPDATE legal_documents
   SET body = E'*Limitation of Liability*\n\nPlease read this carefully. It limits what *ServerPe App Solutions* is responsible for.\n\n*We are not responsible for:*\n• Any loss arising from the service being unavailable, delayed, interrupted, suspended or withdrawn.\n• Messages that WhatsApp fails to deliver, delivers late, or delivers out of order. WhatsApp is operated by Meta, not by us, and we have no control over it.\n• Your mobile network, your device, your internet connection, or the cost of your data.\n• A game result decided by our servers, which is final.\n• Credits spent on a game that had already begun calling numbers, whatever happened next — players leaving, players not responding, or the room closing early. Credits are never taken for a game that never called a number.\n• Any money, goods, favours, bets or arrangements that players make between themselves. Such arrangements are not part of this service, are not endorsed, facilitated or monitored by us, and are entirely at the participants'' own risk.\n• Any unlawful act committed by a player using this service.\n• Anything that happens outside this service, including on other apps, groups or websites.\n• Loss of data, points, leaderboard position, or an opportunity to win.\n\n*Your responsibility*\nYou are responsible for how you use this service and for obeying the laws that apply to you. If using this service is unlawful where you live, you must stop.\n\n*To the fullest extent permitted by law*, the service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. Our total liability to you for any claim connected with the service is limited to the amount you have actually paid us in the twelve months before the claim — which, while the service is free, is zero.\n\nNothing in this policy limits liability that cannot lawfully be limited, including for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, or for fraud.\n\nOperated by *ServerPe App Solutions*. Contact: support@mastipe.in',
       version = version + 1,
       effective_from = now(),
       updated_at = now()
 WHERE doc_key = 'liability';

UPDATE legal_documents
   SET body = E'*Terms & Conditions*\n\nBy using MastiPe you agree to these terms.\n\n*1. Who may use this service*\nYou must be at least 18 years old, or the age of majority where you live, and legally able to enter into these terms.\n\n*2. Your account*\nYour WhatsApp number identifies you. You are responsible for everything done through your number. Do not let others play as you.\n\n*3. Acceptable use*\nYou agree not to: cheat or exploit faults in the game; use bots, scripts or automation; create multiple accounts to obtain free games or promotional credits more than once; harass, abuse or impersonate other players or us; attempt to disrupt, overload or gain unauthorised access to the service; resell or commercialise access; or use the service for anything unlawful.\n\n*4. Fair play*\nGame results are decided by our servers and are final. Numbers are drawn from a random sequence fixed at the start of each round. If we find evidence of cheating or abuse we may void a result, remove you from a game, withdraw free games or promotional credits, or block you permanently.\n\n*5. Suspension and closure*\nWe may suspend or close an account that breaches these terms. Where an account is closed for a serious breach, unused *promotional* credits and free games are forfeited. Credits you have *paid for* are not forfeited; write to us and we will discuss them with you.\n\n*6. Availability*\nThe service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. It may be interrupted, delayed or withdrawn at any time. Games may be cancelled for technical reasons.\n\n*7. Messaging*\nWe communicate with you on WhatsApp. Message and data charges from your mobile provider are your responsibility. You can stop at any time by sending *STOP*.\n\n*8. Changes to these terms*\nWe may update these terms. If we do, you will be asked to accept the new version before your next game.\n\n*9. Ending your use*\nYou may stop using the service at any time.\n\n*10. Governing law*\nThese terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts of Bengaluru, Karnataka have exclusive jurisdiction.\n\nOperated by *ServerPe App Solutions*. Contact: support@mastipe.in',
       version = version + 1,
       effective_from = now(),
       updated_at = now()
 WHERE doc_key = 'terms';
